 "drivers_notes": "Header above board maps axis to socket: E4=M7, E3=M6, E2=M5, E1=M4, E0=M3, Z=M2, Y=M1, X=M0. Inset pin numbering: pin1 EN, pin7 STEP, pin8 DIR, pin17 NC, pin19 DIAG label as shown. Silkscreen blocks print EN/DIR/STEP/CS/PDN only (no DIAG pin name); M0-M5 blocks have a 2-pin 'DIAG' jumper drawn, M6/M7 do not. Pin 19 for E3-MOT and E4-MOT is drawn as 'NC'.",
